You must have a real email at IONOS

In exim4.conf.template, change in line 1855 "your_email"
In passwd.client, change "your_email" and replace XXXXXXXXX by your password
In update-exim4.conf.conf, change in line 22 "you_domain"
Copy this 3 files in /etc/exim4 directory
Execute these commands :
sudo chown root:root /etc/exim4 -R
sudo chown root:Debian-exim /etc/exim4/passwd.client
sudo update-exim4.conf
sudo systemctl restart exim4

Some useful commands :
- To force to send the mail in the queue : 
sudo exim -qff
- To delete all mail in the queue
sudo exim -bp | awk '{print $3}' | grep '^[0-9A-Za-z]\{6,20\}-' | xargs -r sudo exim -Mrm
